                He puts his bag on the bottom bunk.
            "#,

            when: [
                Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
            ],
        ),
    ],

    next: Some("act1_002.barracks_close"),
),

(
    act: 1,
    sub: 2,
    location: "barracks_214",
    id: "act1_002.barracks_could_be_worse",
    messages: [
        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"Could it?\"",
        ),

        (
            speaker: None,
            text: r#"
                He throws his bag onto the bottom bunk.
            "#,
        ),
    ],

    next: Some("act1_002.barracks_close"),
),

(
    act: 1,
    sub: 2,
    location: "barracks_214",
    id: "act1_002.barracks_one_less",
    messages: [
        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"You're going to run that into the ground, aren't you.\"",

            when: [
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: None,
            text: r#"
                He doesn't answer. He puts his bag on the bottom bunk.
            "#,

            when: [
                Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
            ],
        ),
    ],

    next: Some("act1_002.barracks_close"),
),

(
    act: 1,
    sub: 2,
    location: "barracks_214",
    id: "act1_002.barracks_silent",
    messages: [
        (
            speaker: None,
            text: r#"
                You drop your bag beside the bunk.

                He waits for you to say something about the arrangement. You don't, so he stops waiting and starts unpacking.
            "#,
        ),
    ],

    next: Some("act1_002.barracks_close"),
),

(
    act: 1,
    sub: 2,
    location: "barracks_214",
    id: "act1_002.barracks_close",
    messages: [
        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"See you at five, then.\"",

            when: [
                TomasFirstImpression(Warm),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"We're going to hate each other by Friday.\"",

            when: [
                TomasFirstImpression(Teasing),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"Still not sure what to make of you.\"",

            when: [
                TomasFirstImpression(Blunt),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"We can stay out of each other's way.\"",

            when: [
                TomasFirstImpression(Distant),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: None,
            text: r#"
                He unpacks. Folded, squared, put away in an order he decided on before he got here.
            "#,

            when: [
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"That thing you did at the desk. Don't do it in front of cadre.\"",

            when: [
                Flag(TomasNoticedCadetDeceptive),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"Back at the desk. You knew where that declaration was before I did.\"",

            when: [
                Any([
                    Flag(TomasNoticedCadetObservant),
                    Flag(TomasNoticedCadetMemory),
                ]),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"You caught that stack before I knew it was going.\"",

            when: [
                Flag(TomasNoticedCadetQuickHands),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"For what it's worth. Nobody in that line was at their best today.\"",

            when: [
                Flag(CadetSharedVulnerabilityWithTomas),
                Not(
                    Any([
                        Flag(TomasNoticedCadetDeceptive),
                        Flag(TomasNoticedCadetObservant),
                        Flag(TomasNoticedCadetMemory),
                        Flag(TomasNoticedCadetQuickHands),
                    ]),
                ),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"You were right about the line, by the way. My legs are dead.\"",

            when: [
                Flag(CadetGaveTomasPracticalAdvice),
                Not(
                    Any([
                        Flag(TomasNoticedCadetDeceptive),
                        Flag(TomasNoticedCadetObservant),
                        Flag(TomasNoticedCadetMemory),
                        Flag(TomasNoticedCadetQuickHands),
                        Flag(CadetSharedVulnerabilityWithTomas),
                    ]),
                ),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"That thing at the desk. About the recruiter.\"",

            when: [
                Flag(CadetOpenlyQuestionedAuthority),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: None,
            text: r#"
                He looks at the portrait on the wall. The same one as the desk, smaller, and just as crooked.
            "#,

            when: [
                Flag(CadetOpenlyQuestionedAuthority),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"You said it out loud. In a line. Under one of those.\"",

            when: [
                Flag(CadetOpenlyQuestionedAuthority),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"I'm not saying you're wrong. I'm saying there were forty people behind you who want your slot.\"",

            when: [
                Flag(CadetOpenlyQuestionedAuthority),
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
            ],
        ),

        // Offended: no closing conversation
        (
            speaker: None,
            text: r#"
                He unpacks without looking up.
            "#,

            when: [
                Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"Don't move my stuff.\"",

            when: [
                Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
            ],
        ),

        (
            speaker: None,
            text: r#"
                A whistle cuts through the corridor.
            "#,
        ),

        (
            speaker: Some("Tomás"),
            text: "\"Guess we're stuck with each other.\"",

            when: [
                Not(
                    Flag(CadetOffendedTomas),
                ),
                Not(
                    TomasFirstImpression(Distant),
                ),
            ],
        ),
    ],

    next: Some("act1_003.start"),
),

